    {
      "text": "Casa Inclusiva is one of three sites in the Julian & Tripp Mixed-Use Development (913 units total) covered by one Initial Study/MND: Vila de Camila at 1325 E Julian St (H22-012), Casa Inclusiva at 1347 E Julian St (H22-001) and Residencias Arianna at 1298 Tripp Ave (H21-050).",
