        "SRC-002527",
        "SRC-002528"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Initial Study: one six-story, about 63,097 sq ft apartment building, maximum height about 77.5 ft, on two vacant parcels (APN 249-65-060 designated Urban Village, APN 249-65-058 Residential Neighborhood); residential and commercial components are on APN 249-65-060. Zoning HI and R-1-8. 11 trees removed. Site plans credited to Anderson Architects, February 2023.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002527"
      ]
    },
